{
  "chapter_id": "13",
  "chapter_name": "緊急狀況",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "13-001",
      "en": "Help! Call an ambulance, please!",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "ambulance",
          "kk": "/ˈæmbjələns/",
          "zh": "救護車"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "救命！請叫救護車！",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical"
      ],
      "tips": "美國緊急電話是 911，英國是 999，歐盟通用 112，出發前請記下目的地的緊急號碼。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-002",
      "en": "I've lost my passport. Where is the nearest embassy?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "passport",
          "kk": "/ˈpæsˌpɔrt/",
          "zh": "護照"
        },
        {
          "word": "embassy",
          "kk": "/ˈɛmbəsɪ/",
          "zh": "大使館"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的護照遺失了，最近的大使館在哪裡？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "passport",
        "embassy"
      ],
      "tips": "護照遺失應立即向當地警察局報案取得報案證明，再持證明前往我國大使館或辦事處申請補發。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-003",
      "en": "I think I'm having an allergic reaction.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "allergic",
          "kk": "/əˈlɝdʒɪk/",
          "zh": "過敏的"
        },
        {
          "word": "reaction",
          "kk": "/rɪˈækʃən/",
          "zh": "反應"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我覺得我有過敏反應。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical",
        "allergy"
      ],
      "tips": "有食物或藥物過敏史者，建議隨身攜帶寫有過敏資訊的英文卡片，並自備抗組織胺或腎上腺素筆。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-004",
      "en": "My wallet has been stolen.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "stolen",
          "kk": "/ˈstolən/",
          "zh": "被盜"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的錢包被偷了。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "theft"
      ],
      "tips": "遭竊後請立即：1. 向警方報案；2. 通知銀行掛失信用卡；3. 聯絡旅遊保險公司申請理賠。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-005",
      "en": "I need to see a doctor. I have a high fever.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "fever",
          "kk": "/ˈfivɚ/",
          "zh": "發燒"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我需要看醫生，我發高燒。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical"
      ],
      "tips": "出國前請購買旅遊醫療保險，並保存保單號碼與緊急聯絡電話，看診時出示保險卡可能免先付款。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-006",
      "en": "Please call the police. There's been an accident.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "police",
          "kk": "/pəˈlis/",
          "zh": "警察"
        },
        {
          "word": "accident",
          "kk": "/ˈæksɪdənt/",
          "zh": "意外事故"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "請報警，這裡發生了事故。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "accident",
        "police"
      ],
      "tips": "遇到交通事故，不論責任歸屬，都應先報警並保留現場，等候警察製作事故報告。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-007",
      "en": "I'm allergic to penicillin.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "allergic",
          "kk": "/əˈlɝdʒɪk/",
          "zh": "過敏的"
        },
        {
          "word": "penicillin",
          "kk": "/ˌpɛnɪˈsɪlɪn/",
          "zh": "青黴素"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我對盤尼西林過敏。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical",
        "allergy"
      ],
      "tips": "就醫時務必主動告知醫護人員過敏藥物，避免誤用造成嚴重後果。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-008",
      "en": "I need to make an emergency call to Taiwan.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "emergency",
          "kk": "/ɪˈmɝdʒənsɪ/",
          "zh": "緊急狀況"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我需要緊急致電台灣。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "communication"
      ],
      "tips": "從海外撥打台灣請先加國碼 +886，再去掉區號或手機號碼前的 0。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-009",
      "en": "Can you tell me where the nearest hospital is?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "hospital",
          "kk": "/ˈhɑspɪtl/",
          "zh": "醫院"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你能告訴我最近的醫院在哪裡嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical",
        "directions"
      ],
      "tips": "情況不危急時，也可先前往 Urgent Care（緊急診所），費用比急診室低，且等候時間通常較短。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-010",
      "en": "I have travel insurance. Here is my policy number.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "insurance",
          "kk": "/ɪnˈʃʊrəns/",
          "zh": "保險"
        },
        {
          "word": "policy",
          "kk": "/ˈpɑləsɪ/",
          "zh": "政策"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我有旅遊保險，這是我的保單號碼。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "insurance"
      ],
      "tips": "建議將保單號碼與緊急救援電話截圖存於手機，或抄寫在紙上隨身攜帶，以防手機沒電或遺失。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-011",
      "en": "I lost my luggage. I need to file a lost baggage report.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "luggage",
          "kk": "/ˈlʌɡɪdʒ/",
          "zh": "行李"
        },
        {
          "word": "report",
          "kk": "/rɪˈpɔrt/",
          "zh": "報告"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的行李遺失了，我需要填寫行李遺失報告。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "luggage",
        "airline"
      ],
      "tips": "行李遺失請立即在機場行李服務櫃台（Baggage Service Counter）填寫 PIR（財產不規則報告）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-012",
      "en": "I feel dizzy and I can't breathe well.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "dizzy",
          "kk": "/ˈdɪzɪ/",
          "zh": "暈眩的"
        },
        {
          "word": "breathe",
          "kk": "/brið/",
          "zh": "呼吸"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我感到頭暈，而且呼吸不順。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "emergency",
        "medical",
        "symptoms"
      ],
      "tips": "描述症狀時越具體越好，例如說明發病時間、持續多久、有無服藥，方便醫師快速診斷。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
